direction: right
Customer: Customer {shape: person}
ReturnsAPI: Returns API {shape: rectangle}
Saga: Return saga {shape: hexagon}
Orders: Order service {shape: rectangle}
Warehouse: Warehouse service {shape: rectangle}
Carrier: Shipping carrier {shape: cloud}
Refunds: Refund service {shape: rectangle}
Inventory: Inventory service {shape: rectangle}
ReturnsDB: Returns database {shape: cylinder}
Customer -> ReturnsAPI: request return
ReturnsAPI -> Saga
Saga -> Orders: validate return window
Orders -> Saga: return approved
Saga -> Carrier: create return label
Carrier -> Saga: label created
Saga -> ReturnsDB: awaiting parcel
Warehouse -> Saga: parcel received
Saga -> Warehouse: inspect item
Warehouse -> Saga: item accepted
Saga -> Refunds: issue refund
Refunds -> Saga: refund completed
Saga -> Inventory: restock item
Saga -> ReturnsDB: mark complete
Orders -> Saga: return rejected
Warehouse -> Saga: item rejected
Saga -> Refunds: cancel refund
Saga -> ReturnsDB: mark rejected
